This is an abbreviation that has several variants; try searching
on each of them, and you'll find plenty.

YKYBPTMN ('you've', rather than 'you have')
YKYBPTMNW (with and without a trailing 'when')
YKYBPTMNHW (NetHack can be abbreviated with one initial or two)

and combinations on those themes.

There's also YKYBPNHTLW ("...playing NetHack too long...") with a
similar set of variations.
 
